Title: Friedrich Ebert
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, reformist
card-image: img/portraits/EbertFriedrich.jpg
view-if: ebert_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Friedrich Ebert

Ebert is [? if chancellor = "Ebert": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Ebert": the current President and ?] the first President of the Republic. He is a controversial figure – to the Reformists, he is the Father of the Republic. To the Left faction and the [+ uspd_name +], he is a traitor to Socialism. He is currently in ill health, but refusing treatment while he defends himself amid a Defamation case.

- @get_medical_help
- @party_discipline
- @reichsexecution_lefties
- @democratic_rally
- @weimar_relations
- @bourgeois_relations
- @military_affairs
- @boost_reformists_influence_blatant: Ebert will openly promote the Reformist faction.
- @grand_coalition_relations: Ebert will use his connections to attempt to come to an understanding with the bourgeois parties.
- @reduce_reformists_dissent: Ebert will work to reduce dissent within the Reformist faction.
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@get_medical_help
title: Push Ebert to get medical treatment.
subtitle: We cannot risk the health of our President and one of our most notable figures.
choose-if: never
unavailable-subtitle: Ebert refuses.

@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5

Despite his ill health, Ebert has enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.

@reichsexecution_lefties
title: The Watchful Eye
subtitle: Ebert is prepared to Reichsexekute any radical left state government.
choose-if: never
unavailable-subtitle: There are no radical left state governments at the current time.

@democratic_rally
title: Rally for democracy
subtitle: Rally our party and the German people to defend democracy and freedom.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; pro_republic += 5; democratization += 1; neorevisionist_strength += 5; reformist_strength += 3; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; new_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4

Despite his ill-health, Ebert helps us to rally the people in defense of democracy.

@military_affairs
title: Military affairs
subtitle: We can set our military policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government and reichswehr_minister_party == "SPD"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not in government. ?][? if reichswehr_minister_party != "SPD": The SPD does not have the Reichswehr ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: military_policy

@boost_reformists_influence_blatant
on-arrival: reformists_strength += 10; reformists_dissent -= 5; center_dissent += 3; labor_dissent += 3; left_dissent += 3

Ebert has openly promoted the Reformist faction, to the anger of the other factions.

@grand_coalition_relations
on-arrival: z_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 3 ; dvp_relation += 3 ;

Despite his ill-health, Ebert has used his connections to try to come to an understanding with the Bourgeois parties.

@reduce_reformists_dissent
on-arrival: reformists_dissent -= 10

Despite his ill-health, Ebert has worked to reduce dissent within the Reformist faction.

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Ebert can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Ebert"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Ebert can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Ebert"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
